    f"only in legacy-markers.md: {sorted(_tbl - _cen) or 'none'} · "
    f"only in bin/baseline: {sorted(_cen - _tbl) or 'none'} — a family in one and not "
    "the other is either never detected or reported unclassified forever",
)

