# HARD CEILING for MCP (fact 13: ToolSearch searched a server its grant never named
# and the schema was withheld), so that change silently cut every generated IC off
# from every configured server. Measured the same day on apps-odyssey-alive: two
# employees whose bodies route through nanobanana-mcp / playwright-mcp passed all 138
# text checks and could not reach either.
