      "reversible by construction" in ct,
      "batch size was treated as a risk axis; a verified backup plus per-skill .orig plus disband "
      "means it is not one, and saying so is what removes the reason to stop")

# No shipped file may re-authorize the split. This is the regression guard:
# fact 8 has become a blocking check twice already.
_split_authorizers = sorted(
